        {
          "text": "YÜN Shou-p'ing 惲壽平 (T. 正叔, H. 東園草衣生, 白雲外史, 園容, 壽平子), 1633–1690, poet and artist, was a native of Yang-hu, Kiangsu. His original name was Yün Ko 惲格 (T. 壽平), but he was commonly known by one of his hao as Yün Nan-t'ien (南田).",
